        "text": "As a matter of fact, smart contracts exist so that legal contracts don't have to be made. There's no need to get a lawyer, a court, or a government to enforce contract law if everything that needs to happen in an agreement happens automatically when the predefined conditions are met. As the saying goes in code we trust, smart contracts have unique characteristics. Ethereum smart contracts often are distributed, meaning that smart contracts are replicated and distributed in all nodes of the Ethereum network. Ethereum smart contracts are also deterministic. They only perform the actions they were designed to. When the requirements are met, the outcome will always be the same.",
